## Empty period

The example names the selected week and its time zone. An empty period stays distinct from a failed request ([WG-038](../../content/writing-guidelines/states-and-errors.html#wg-038)).

<%= example("pub-frontend-templates-calendar-2") %>
## Acceptance checks

- Repeated and all-day events keep their native meaning.
- Today, the selected date and event status do not rely on colour alone.
- An empty period is different from a failed calendar request.
- Narrow screens keep event titles, dates and times.

